<title>FRANCE: Paribas says sold Elf shares.</title>
<headline>Paribas says sold Elf shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas has sold about two million shares in oil group Elf-Aquitaine in the New York market overnight, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Market sources said the transaction was at a price of 557 francs per share.  </p>
<p>&quot;Paris has placed, primarily with institutional investors in New York tonight, some two million shares in Elf-Aquitaine, &quot; the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The placement concerns some 0.7 percent of the oil company's capital.</p>
<p>Shares in Elf were down 1.37 percent at 576 francs at 0955 GMT.</p>
</text>
